  PERSONA_SYNC
  DIAGRAM_GENERATION
  PATENT_REVIEW // AI-powered patent draft review (Pro tier)
  IDEATION // Mind-map patent ideation engine
  FUNDING_DISCOVERY
  GRANT_PREP
  GRANT_DRAFTING
  FUNDING_CHAT // AI funding chatbot (Pro tier)
  FUNDING_INTELLIGENCE // Funding intelligence / RAG / idea intelligence (Pro tier)
